  * pppd logs (pppdump-format files)
  * VMS TCPTRACE
  * DBS Etherwatch (text format)
  * Catapult DCT2000 (.out files)
 .
 Wiretap's shortcomings are: no filter capability and no support for packet
 capture.
 .
